      <div xml:id="v78d89-a5hmww"><!-- q22prae -->
        <head xml:id="v78d89-a5hmww-Hd1e101">Praeambulum</head>
        <p xml:id="v78d89-a5hmww-d1e103">
          <lb ed="#N" n="48"/>Questio. xxii. de compa
          <lb ed="#N" n="49"/>tione baptismatum inter seinuicem.
        </p>
        <p xml:id="v78d89-a5hmww-d1e110">
          <lb ed="#N" n="50"/>SEquitur de compa
          <lb ed="#N" n="51"/>ratione baptismatis huius ad alia
          gene<lb ed="#N" n="52" break="no"/>ra baptismatum que dicuntur baptismata
          <lb ed="#N" n="53"/>a damas. Primo queritur. vtrum sint
          sacra<lb ed="#N" n="54" break="no"/>menta. Secundo si sint aliqua genera
          ba<lb ed="#N" n="55" break="no"/>ptismatum preter illa. Tercio si aliqua genera baptisma
          <lb ed="#N" n="56"/>tum representabant baptisma completum id est baptisma aque
          <lb ed="#N" n="57"/>et spiritus san. Quarto de differentia baptismi sanguinis et
          pe<lb ed="#N" n="58" break="no"/>nitentie: respectu eius quod est aque et spiritus. Quinto de
          pre<lb ed="#N" n="59" break="no"/>eminentia baptismatum.
        </p>
      </div>
    </body>
